---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | Kirian Luna | Software Engineer"
  description="Privacy policy and technical data handling principles for kirian.dev. No tracking cookies, no advertising scripts, and full transparency."
  lang="en"
>
  <Navbar />

  <main id="main-content" class="min-h-screen bg-grayscale-1">
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-0 pt-28 pb-16 flex flex-col gap-10">
      
      <!-- Back Link -->
      <div>
        <a
          href="/"
          data-cuelume-hover="tick"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-mono text-grayscale-10 hover:text-grayscale-12 transition-colors select-none"
        >
          <span>←</span>
          <span>Home</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Intro Block -->
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3.5">
        <h1 class="text-sm font-semibold text-grayscale-12 font-mono tracking-tight select-none">
          Privacy
        </h1>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-grayscale-11 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            This site is a personal engineering portfolio designed with a strong commitment to privacy, data minimization, and transparency. It sets no invasive advertising cookies, runs no behavioral profiling scripts, and never collects personal data without your explicit knowledge.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Minimal Two-Column Structured Sections -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 text-xs sm:text-[13px] leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- Services -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-grayscale-10 select-none">Services</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-grayscale-11">
            <p>
              The website is deployed on <a href="https://vercel.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Vercel</a>, a global edge network that processes standard HTTP requests solely to deliver content and safeguard infrastructure against abuse. Direct inquiries sent through the contact page are handled securely by <a href="https://resend.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Resend</a> and forwarded directly to my private inbox, used exclusively to reply. Article reactions and counters run on an <a href="https://upstash.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Upstash</a> serverless Redis database that stores irreversible cryptographic hashes to prevent spam while preserving complete anonymity.
            </p>
            <p>
              Traffic metrics are measured through a privacy focused configuration of <a href="https://posthog.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">PostHog</a> that captures aggregate pageviews and device types without persistent tracking cookies or personal profiling. Live activity and music status in the footer query public read only endpoints from Spotify and Discord Lanyard only upon user interaction. No listening history or personal identity from your device is ever read or shared.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Your browser -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-grayscale-10 select-none">Your browser</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-grayscale-11">
            <p>
              Your visual theme preference between dark mode and light mode is saved locally in your browser localStorage so the site remembers your choice across visits. Audio feedback preferences for interface interactions are kept in active session memory. This information remains strictly on your device and is never transmitted to any external server.
            </p>
            <p>
              External links to platforms such as <a href="https://github.com/kirianL" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">GitHub</a> or <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/kirianluna" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">LinkedIn</a> open under the independent privacy policies of those respective services.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Questions -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[130px_1fr] gap-2 sm:gap-6 items-baseline">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-grayscale-10 select-none">Questions</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 text-grayscale-11">
            <p>
              If you have any questions regarding how technical information is handled, or if you wish to request the deletion of any communication you sent, feel free to reach out directly by email at <a href="mailto:kirianluna.u@gmail.com" class="text-grayscale-12 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">kirianluna.u@gmail.com</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>

      <Footer />
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
